  "prefLabel": "Eth 104.05 Access to Committee Administrative Rules",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Eth 104.05 Access to Committee Administrative Rules. The public may:\n\n(a) Inspect and copy the official version of the committee’s administrative rules at the committee’s office;\n\n(b) Receive a copy of the rules by calling or writing the committee; and\n\n(c) Access the rules on the committee’s website at http://doj.nh.gov/ethics-committee.\n\nSource. #12617-A, eff 9-6-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/eth100-200.html"
